    "title": "Clayton County Restaurant Report Card - 09/15/2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Reports ,\n10 hours ago Clayton County Restaurant Report Card – 09/15/2026 The Georgia Department of Public Health conducted food service inspections in Clayton County on 09/15/2026. The following 3 establishments were inspected.\n🔴 Grade U (Failing) = below 70 | 🟠 Grade C = 70–79 | 🟡 Grade B = 80–89 | 🟢 Grade A = 90–100\n🟢 Grade A (90–100) — 3 locations\nAUNTIE ANNE'S - CONC C — 🟢 90 (Grade A)• Inspected: 09-15-2026 • 6000 N TERMINAL PKWY CONC C ATLANTA, GA 30320 • (404) 433-8144THE GRIND (ALADDIN FOOD SERVICE) — 🟢 92 (Grade A)• Inspected: 09-15-2026 • 2000 CLAYTON STATE BLVD MORROW, GA 30260 • (678) 466-4213WAFFLE HOUSE 425 — 🟢 98 (Grade A)• Inspected: 09-15-2026 • 6375 JONESBORO RD MORROW, GA 30260 • (770) 968-3993\nSource: Georgia Environmental Health Food Service Inspection database. Data reflects food service inspections conducted 09/15/2026–09/15/2026.",
